Daddy?

1269
01:33:07,123 --> 01:33:08,499
Jessie.

1270
01:33:08,583 --> 01:33:10,376
You're gonna be
all right, honey.

1271
01:33:10,460 --> 01:33:11,710
You're gonna
be all right.

